  "decision": "HOLD",
  "fix_description": "Replace MD5-based password hashing with a strong adaptive algorithm such as bcrypt, argon2, or scrypt using a per-user random salt. Update hash_password() to generate a salted hash (e.g. bcrypt.hashpw), verify_password() to compare using the algorithm's constant-time check (e.g. bcrypt.checkpw), and change_password() to store the new salted hash. Add the chosen library to dependencies and provide a strategy for rehashing/migrating any existing MD5-stored credentials, since MD5 is cryptographically broken and unsuitable for password storage.",
